---
---

<section id="heritage" class="relative py-28 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-12 bg-hotel-dark overflow-hidden border-t border-white/5">
  <!-- Atmospheric background image layer with glass overlay -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img
      src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578683010236-d716f9a3f461?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2200&q=80"
      alt="Atmospheric Stonework Texture"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-10 filter contrast-125"
      loading="lazy"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-hotel-dark via-hotel-charcoal/90 to-hotel-dark"></div>
    <div class="ambient-glow top-0 right-1/4 opacity-20"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <!-- Left Column: Photography Composition -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 relative kinetic-left">
        <div class="relative z-10 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-hotel-border/40 shadow-2xl h-[480px] sm:h-[560px]">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1591088398332-8a7791972843?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80"
            alt="Handcrafted architectural stonework at The Northern"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover filter brightness-90"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-hotel-dark/80 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>

          <!-- Bottom Quote Overlay -->
          <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-6 right-6 glass-panel p-5 rounded-sm">
            <p class="font-serif italic text-sm sm:text-base text-hotel-sand-light leading-relaxed">
              "We built not to overpower the northern horizon, but to provide a quiet, permanent sanctuary within it."
            </p>
            <span class="block text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-hotel-gold mt-2 font-mono">
              Principal Architect, 2021
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Secondary Accents -->
        <div class="hidden sm:block absolute -bottom-8 -right-8 w-48 h-48 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border-2 border-hotel-gold/30 shadow-2xl z-20">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578683010236-d716f9a3f461?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80"
            alt="Detail of local quarry masonry"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column: Editorial Narrative -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-8 kinetic-right">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
            <span class="w-8 h-[1px] bg-hotel-gold"></span>
            <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-hotel-gold font-semibold">Architectural Philosophy</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl text-hotel-sand-light tracking-tight leading-tight">
            Crafted from Ancient Basalt & Northern Timber
          </h2>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-hotel-sand/90 font-light leading-relaxed">
          The Northern was conceived as a permanent architectural statement honoring the rugged beauty of Northern Uganda. Rising from the outskirts of Gulu, every wall incorporates hand-chiseled volcanic granite quarried by regional master stonemasons, complemented by reclaimed hardwood timbers and expansive thermal glass.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-2 kinetic-stagger-parent">
          <div class="glass-card p-5 rounded-sm border border-white/5 kinetic-card">
            <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-hotel-gold mb-1 font-semibold">100%</div>
            <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-hotel-sand font-medium mb-1">Solar & Geothermal Grid</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-hotel-muted font-light leading-relaxed">
              Quiet micro-grid infrastructure delivering silent uninterrupted energy and filtered borehole waters.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="glass-card p-5 rounded-sm border border-white/5 kinetic-card">
            <div class="font-serif text-3xl text-hotel-gold mb-1 font-semibold">85%</div>
            <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-hotel-sand font-medium mb-1">Local Craftsmanship</div>
            <p class="text-xs text-hotel-muted font-light leading-relaxed">
              Every ceramic fixture, woven drape, and carved headboard is authored by northern artisans.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center gap-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full border border-hotel-gold/40 flex items-center justify-center bg-hotel-gold/10">
              <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-hotel-gold" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-hotel-sand font-semibold">Discretion & Protocol</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-hotel-muted">Trusted by diplomatic missions, heads of state, and leaders</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

